hereValue in entry
hereValue invokes machine.toInt64
hereValue argument address machine.Address here copy
hereValue result hereAt Int64
hereValue ownedBy none
hereValue cleanedBy none
hereValue borrows none
hereValue catch none
hereValue suppresses none

