findFloor in entry
findFloor invokes math.subtractInt64
findFloor argument left Int64 hereAt copy
findFloor argument right Int64 stackBudget copy
findFloor result floor Int64
findFloor ownedBy none
findFloor cleanedBy none
findFloor borrows none
findFloor catch none
findFloor suppresses none

